---
description: Keep ES and EN message keys in sync in the same edit
globs: frontend/src/app/core/i18n/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# i18n edits

- Source copy: Spanish (`es`).
- Every key add/change/delete in `i18n.ts` → update **`es` and `en` together**.
- Prefer translating in the same PR/edit; do not merge ES-only UI strings.
- `MessageKey` is derived from `es`; missing `en` keys fail at runtime when locale is EN.
